[
  {
    "name": "OpenBB Workspace - Analysis Dashboard",
    "description": "OpenBB's Analysis Dashboard on openbq-docker's widget ids: eleven tabs for a trading desk, from analyst and fundamentals through bull and bear researchers, traders, risk and a backtest gate. Each holds EODHD price history (NVDA, AAPL, MSFT, QQQ) or AAPL's annual balance sheet and cash flow. EODHD needs the openbq-eodhd extension and a key. Opens in BDOBB 9.0.0 or later.",
